        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Midnight ice cream store: Fixed version.",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN_EBOLA",
        "PublicId": "115886100141",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/scene_ebola.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 4b83cf74-a44e-4923-ac31-a1fccb92342f).Image",
        "Description": "it is currently 3:07AM at the store. Kill all the ice cream staffs, then escape the mission before it reaches 6:00AM. if it reaches 6:00AM, the ice cream store is going to close, Diana Wood would be mad at you for being late, and the mission would fail.\r\r\r\rFrom now on: The latest version was not going well, because the time limit was optional, instead of non-optional, and i missed one ice cream staff named Jack Please, the waiter. So i have made another version of it, and it is labeled as fixed.",
